WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:06.359
<v Sabir>There’s a bale of hay beside the barn, and a long trough next to it.

00:00:09.659 --> 00:00:15.908
<v Sabir>Water is flowing from the pipe. Can you point to where it will go?

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:25.587
<v Sabir>Into the trough! Look, the water is rising.

00:00:28.887 --> 00:00:34.816
<v Sabir>A woolly sheep is coming from the field. It stops by the trough and bends down to drink.

00:00:38.116 --> 00:00:45.085
<v Sabir>Here are real sheep. There are several on the grassy hill. Can you point to one?

00:00:48.385 --> 00:00:55.034
<v Sabir>Sheep eat grass and drink clean water. Thank Allah for giving water to us and to the animals.
